Pruigew
$cards
DECK 8 SPADES

$initial
COLUMN 5 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 10 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 0 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 3 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 7 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 1 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 4 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 5 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 10 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 5 FACE_ALL

TIOFA 2 FACE_LAST
TIOFA 4 FACE_LAST
TIOFA 2 FACE_LAST
TIOFA 9 FACE_LAST
TIOFA 10 FACE_HALF
TIOFA 7 FACE_HALF
TIOFA 8 FACE_HALF
TIOFA 6 FACE_HALF
TIOFA 6 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE COLUMN TIOFA
DESTSRC Suit alternate_color
MOVE TIOFA TIOFA
SRC Rank K
MOVE_STACK COLUMN TIOFA
OR
    SRC Suit {HEARTS, SPADES, DIAMONDS, CLUBS}
    SRCSTACK Size < 0
MOVE_STACK TIOFA COLUMN
SRC Suit {CLUBS}
$win
PILE ALL TIOFA Empty
